Package: signtest
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Fast harness exercising out-of-container signing
 Builds the kernel's extract-cert tool and runs it against the glbx signing
 token, so the full signing path (forwarding module, socket, host service) is
 exercised without a kernel build.
